This licence covers the software in this repository: index.html and the
builder under build/. Use it for anything, including commercially; the one
condition is that this notice travels with it.

It does NOT and legally cannot cover the flight and map data under data/,
which is derived from third-party sources that keep their own terms:

- **Flight records** — OpenSky Network ADS-B data, mirrored as plain CSV by
  ActiveConclusion's [COVID19_AirTraffic](https://github.com/ActiveConclusion/COVID19_AirTraffic)
  (MIT). If you reuse the underlying flight data, OpenSky asks for a citation:
  Schäfer, M., Strohmeier, M., Lenders, V., Martinovic, I., Wilhelm, M.
  "Bringing Up OpenSky: A Large-scale ADS-B Sensor Network for Research."
  IPSN 2014.
- **Airport coordinates** — [OurAirports](https://github.com/davidmegginson/ourairports-data),
  released into the public domain by its maintainers.
- **Basemap** — [Natural Earth](https://www.naturalearthdata.com/) via
  [world-atlas](https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas), public domain.

If you reuse the data, credit the original publishers.
